      "statement": "theorem mean_value_theorem {a b : ℝ} (hab : a < b) {f : ℝ → ℝ} (hf : ContinuousOn f (Icc a b)) (hfd : DifferentiableOn ℝ f (Ioo a b)) : ∃ c ∈ Ioo a b, deriv f c = (f b - f a) / (b - a)"
